      "comment": "PHOENIX AMELIA (6) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 25.51 beating Infra Terra. Can measure up again. ULTIMATE ETHICS (7) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (19.40) at Q Straight latest. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. AKELA JUDO (8) turned in a solid run last start over 457m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (25.88). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Key player if finds best. MUSCOVITE MICA (2) can fill a top-three spot.",
